<title>USA: Integon names John McKinnon president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Integon names John McKinnon president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integon Corp said on Monday that it elected John McKinnon, a current director of the company, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>John Head III, who was previously chief executive while the board was searching for candidates for the post, will continue to serve as chairman of the board, Integon said.</p>
